7	/// The pointer is over the ROW, so the row tells its gutter (`hovered`); the
8	/// gutter decides whether that makes its ◆ a ×. The menu never reads the
9	/// hover: a window that is not key tracks none, and a right-click there must
10	/// offer the same items.
